<title>SWITZERLAND: Share trading in Richemont suspended.</title>
<headline>Share trading in Richemont suspended.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in the shares of Compagnie Financiere Richemont AG will be suspended during Friday pending an important announcement by the company during the afternoon, the Swiss Exchange said.  </p>
<p>Richemont is a Swiss holding company controlled by the Rupert family of South Africa and is active in tobacco, luxury goods, direct retailing and electronic media.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
